<title>Israel and Hezbollah: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/lebanon/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-lebanon-2026-11-27T15:24:55.091Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:24:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has intensified airstrikes and artillery shelling on southern Lebanon, targeting Hezbollah rocket sites, launchers in the Beqaa Valley, and other facilities, while drones have flown over Beirut. Hezbollah is reportedly using fishing boats to spy on the Israeli navy and Israel is employing Christian villages in south Lebanon in a divide-and-conquer effort. Hezbollah’s leader has again demanded the release of five detained operatives and rejected any post-UNIFIL force outside U.N. authority, as both sides prepare for an eighth round of peace talks before year-end. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQYVNUWEJudWFFMWRvc0x3TEpNaGJVU3J0dnJ0dEdNazdJRGlIT2NxTlIwY1cwaW5nbERWQ1FZdlk1blNtZXBYZGVkblNOQnV3WmtNTEI1Szk1OE5Ha2licVJnZktYcnE5T3ZKdGFEcy1wSWFYb1BETW5qSDVmc1ljU0x4QkxZWURUVUhuM3pQeDkzUVQ2RV96OTVJTDEyQW9Fb0Roc2lR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE1BcndwODhjaWRkMGZQMlhkMkRvNjVXdk45Z2xaOVpfWmtUTE9LNHpRT1hUeDZzeXo5ckdPTVNHb21vc1RQc1RWbkNzTXpsZ1k?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة سبأ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQQnRONFdfTlJWVmE4cG1TYW1BbmlqRnNjbmp5VmtPdjdFeVN5eHBwcTZzWnQydEpSS3lRSVpZblp1V1l1NFZORFJFanZXRE5GNENIY1pvLVlWTldQN3U5dFJqWVVxcmR1MzdEdDkzUE5nX1BNQ0M0R3c0RzZ4ZW5la3JZMTdKT25UQ0xGOGJHcEl2WTdQRU1OQy1DN3NYOThyTlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNSmc1dS1DYUdwVS1ST2lyUmpBcEg1R0dyTF9naWRpMU1tbDNVQzhSanVrUW5kMENpd0ltN0hodk9WUTJaSHZPQ3AwMGw0ZzAxOC1iblBwZU5XcGdsWlQ0LUVySjNjcn